      mainEntity: [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How long does a heated lunch box take to heat food?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Most take 30 to 60 minutes to bring a refrigerated meal to eating temperature, and longer for large, dense or very cold portions. Soups and saucy dishes heat fastest; dry leftovers and thick casseroles heat slowest. Frozen food can take hours and is a poor fit. Start heating about an hour before lunch and check the center of the food with a thermometer."
