            "text": "A typical lunch box warmer draws only a few amps at 12 volts, so an hour of heating will not drain a healthy battery. Higher-draw 12-volt ovens, long engine-off stops and other accessories like a fridge add up, though. Run warmers with the engine on when possible, or use a socket that switches off with the ignition."
