            The table shows where the real choices are. If you will only ever plug into a wall, the Crock-Pot Lunch Crock and the 120-volt HOTLOGIC models are simple, well supported and easy to clean. If you split time between a vehicle and a wall outlet, a 3-in-1 box like the Herrfilm saves buying two warmers. If you want food properly hot, not just warm, on the road, the RoadPro oven is in a different league from the lunch boxes, with the higher draw and the care that goes with it.
